### International Bank FOL — Demo API calls (REST Client / curl-like)
### Requires: set {{baseUrl}} and login once to set {{accessToken}}

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = REPLACE_ME
@templateId = REPLACE_ME

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/ping

### Login (copy accessToken from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sunsun",
  "password": "REPLACE_ME"
}

### Create COMPOSITE template
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/composite-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "International Bank Commercial Loan — Facility Offer Letter (FOL) — Full Demo",
  "description": "Enterprise demo composite template: parameters + derived + assembly + OnlyOffice + tests",
  "outputFormat": "WORD"
}

### Get assembly config
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/composite-templates/{{templateId}}/assembly-config
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Parameter schema endpoints
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/templates/{{templateId}}/parameter-schema
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/templates/{{templateId}}/aggregation-schema
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Scan placeholders vs parameter table
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/templates/{{templateId}}/parameters/scan
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Run all test cases
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/templates/{{templateId}}/test-cases/run-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

